 “cancel a pending deletion” control in the admin","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"UI referred to a duration no operator could see or change. Shorter is the more","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"restrictive direction, so a tenant may lower it and not raise it: it is time spent"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"holding data the subject has already asked to have erased, and GDPR Art. 17(1) asks for","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"that to be “without undue delay”. The upper bound of 90 days is where Art. 12(3)’s"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"one-month response deadline plus its two-month extension for complex cases runs out;"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"anything past 30 wants a reason recorded."}],"title":"deletionGracePeriodDays","identifier":"doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK\/PrivacyPolicy\/deletionGracePeriodDays","role":"symbol","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"let"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"deletionGracePeriodDays"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Int","preciseIdentifier":"s:Si"}],"kind":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/axiamsdk\/privacypolicy\/deletiongraceperioddays","type":"topic"},"doc://AxiamSDK/documentation/AxiamSDK/PrivacyPolicy/encode(to:)":{"type":"topic","abstract":[],"fragments":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"encode","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"to","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": any ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Encoder","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:s7EncoderP"},{"text":") ","kind":"text"},{"text":"throws","kind":"keyword"}],"url":"\/documentation\/axiamsdk\/privacypolicy\/encode(to:)","role":"symbol","title":"encode(to:)","kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK\/PrivacyPolicy\/encode(to:)"},"doc://AxiamSDK/SE":{"type":"unresolvab